summary:
  A wake-up alarm on a loud station rings ten decibels under the level its
  form names.

history:
  The alarm's own level is what the room gets, and an alarm has to be heard:
  the factor stands aside while that level stands.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LoudLogic.js

find:
